    "title": "TTD Stock In Spotlight After Firm Ropes In Zendesk Marketing Chief – Retail Hopes New Hires Turn Things Around At Trade Desk",
    "byline": null,
    "published_at": null,
    "site_name": "finance.yahoo.com",
    "language": null
